; Demo journal for the doppio web GUI.
;
; Fictional finances of "Sam Casey", an independent illustrator, over the
; first half of 2024. Designed to exercise every view in the demo:
;   - balance hierarchy with multiple commodities (USD, EUR, AAPL)
;   - balance assertions
;   - lot pricing (cost basis on a stock holding)
;   - cross-currency expenses (a trip to France via P-directive FX)
;   - enough monthly activity on the checking account for a chart
;
; All names, payees, and amounts are entirely fictional. This file is
; intended for demonstration purposes only; do NOT use it as a template
; for real bookkeeping.

account Assets:Bank:Checking
account Assets:Bank:Savings
account Assets:Brokerage
account Assets:Cash:EUR
account Liabilities:CreditCard
account Equity:OpeningBalances
account Income:Consulting
account Expenses:Rent
account Expenses:Groceries
account Expenses:Restaurants
account Expenses:Utilities
account Expenses:Transit
account Expenses:Travel
account Expenses:Entertainment

commodity $
    format $1,000.00
    default

commodity EUR
    format 1,000.00 EUR

P 2024-01-02 EUR $1.09
P 2024-03-01 EUR $1.08
P 2024-05-15 EUR $1.07
P 2024-02-15 AAPL $182.50
P 2024-04-15 AAPL $171.40
P 2024-06-15 AAPL $193.20

